5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I am Toshio. I will observe the others closely. Let us begin.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I’m Kenji. I’m really excited to play this game with you all. Let’s have fun and figure out who the werewolf is,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’m Mizuki. I’ll stay calm and logical. Let’s observe everyone’s behavior carefully before making any judgments.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am Ryuji. I will remain calm and observe. Let us proceed with caution.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I’m Sakura! I’m super excited to play! Let’s have fun and find the werewolf together!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Kenji, your enthusiasm is noted. I prefer to keep my distance. Let us see who acts first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,Hey Toshio! Don’t be so serious. I’m just happy to be here. Let’s all work together to find the bad guy!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji, your energy is refreshing. Toshio, your caution is wise. We need balance. Let’s see who reveals their true nature first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Mizuki. Balance is essential. We must not rush to judgment. Let us gather more information before acting.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Haha, you guys are so serious! I’m just a little girl, so I’ll just watch and giggle. Who’s the sneaky one?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Sakura, your playfulness is noted. Kenji, your eagerness may be a mask. I will watch your reactions closely.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,Hey Toshio! I’m just being friendly! I promise I’m not hiding anything. Let’s all stay positive and find the truth together!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, your suspicion is premature. Kenji’s honesty seems genuine. Let’s not create unnecessary tension before we even have data.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I concur with Mizuki. Premature suspicion is counterproductive. We lack evidence. Let us maintain composure and wait for the night results before forming conclusions.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Toshio, you’re being so grumpy! Kenji is just nice. I’ll keep my eyes peeled for the sneaky wolf. Let’s stay friends!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,Mizuki is right. Premature suspicion is counterproductive. I will remain silent and observe. Let us wait for the night results before forming conclusions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with everyone! Let’s stay calm and friendly. I’m just a normal villager trying to help. Good night, friends","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Let us rest and await the night’s results. Good evening, everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Rest well. We will assess the situation with clarity tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
