31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The night has passed. I have no information to share. Let us hear from the others before we decide.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I’m just a normal villager here. I didn’t see anything weird last night. Who else wants to share their thoughts?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I have no information to share. Let us listen to the others.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf. I will explain my reasoning shortly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa! Ryuji, that’s a big accusation! Are you sure? I don’t want to jump to conclusions without proof.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Ryuji, your accusation is bold. Mizuki, please respond. Why would you target her without evidence?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Hey Ryuji! That’s a huge claim! Mizuki, are you really the wolf? I’m scared but I trust you guys.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Ryuji, that is a reckless accusation. I have no proof to offer, but I trust my own logic. Why target me specifically?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Mizuki, my divination is absolute. You are the werewolf. I will not retract this. The evidence is clear.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ryuji, that’s scary! If you’re the Seer, I believe you. But why Mizuki? She seemed so calm and logical to me!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Ryuji, your certainty is suspicious. If you are the Seer, why did you not speak on Day 0? Explain your silence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Toshio, that’s a fair point! But Ryuji seems really sure. I’m just a villager, so I don’t know what to do.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, silence is strategic. Ryuji, your sudden certainty is suspicious. Why trust a Seer who hid his power?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Toshio, silence was prudent. I waited for the correct moment. My divination is absolute. Mizuki is the werewolf.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Toshio, that’s a good question! But Ryuji seems really confident. I’m just a little girl, so I don’t know much. Who should we trust?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Ryuji, your silence was indeed strategic. I will not vote yet. Let us hear Sakura’s final thoughts before deciding.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’m really torn! Ryuji sounds so sure, but Toshio’s point makes sense. I don’t want to hurt an innocent friend. Let’s think carefully","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
